  'draft', 'advanced',
  'A 81-year-old man on warfarin for atrial fibrillation, with a stable INR of 2.4, is prescribed a 7-day course of clarithromycin by his GP for a chest infection. Four days later he presents with epistaxis and bruising, and his INR is found to be 8.6.',
  'What is the most appropriate explanation and immediate management?',
  array['warfarin drug interaction','clarithromycin','CYP3A4 inhibition','supratherapeutic INR']
